Long-tail searches (each rests on one fact):
- L1: market size of wealth management platforms (rests on fs.size)
- L2: growth rate of wealth management platforms (rests on fs.cagr)
- L3: robo advisory share of wealth management platforms (rests on fs.segments.0)
- L4: wealth management platforms for brokerage firms (rests on fs.segments.2)
